      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她追求的是──“瞬间”。\n这一点在夏季集训时似乎还是一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd6ac2e306ff6900d2be80f8ef3663a92340d83234858b098eebe6ea434f7f7f",
