      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我接下来也没有安排行程。\n于是决定休息一下，顺便到附近散散步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "043382109907dc8e20e0e2801f8ba5baaa213a13ae5efa426e2dc26749c47cfe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
