      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──对对！听说后面的海滩是私房景点呢！\n景色好像很漂亮，尤其是日出的那瞬间令人惊艳！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a05de273694371d09c694b2f42c9ec1d4a135e24ccb38acdb4f85450c5b9556",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
